# 名前 | 作業ディレクトリ(repo相対) | コマンド   — CI(_app-ci.yml / ci-core.yml)と同じ順
core-lint | packages/core | npm run lint
core-typecheck | packages/core | npm run typecheck
core-test | packages/core | npm run test:coverage
asa-lint | apps/asa | npm run lint
asa-typegen | apps/asa | npx next typegen
asa-typecheck | apps/asa | npx tsc --noEmit
asa-test | apps/asa | npm run test:coverage
asa-build | apps/asa | npm run build
yoru-lint | apps/yoru | npm run lint
yoru-schema | apps/yoru | npm run check:schema
yoru-stub | apps/yoru | npm run check:stub
yoru-typegen | apps/yoru | npx next typegen
yoru-typecheck | apps/yoru | npx tsc --noEmit
yoru-test | apps/yoru | npm run test:coverage
yoru-build | apps/yoru | npm run build
oya-lint | apps/oya | npm run lint
oya-typegen | apps/oya | npx next typegen
oya-typecheck | apps/oya | npx tsc --noEmit
oya-test | apps/oya | npm run test:coverage
oya-build | apps/oya | npm run build
